values as well as changing parameters and setting critical limits
for  the sensors.  In display mode, column widths as well as dis‐
played sensors are fully customizable.  Critical limits or  other
properties  can  be  set via the configuration file.  If critical
limits were set previously, the display mode will show the criti‐
cal limits in addition to the current values.  The following  op‐
